<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/fn/PPA16-FootnoteSPM.20> a ipbes:Footnote ;
    ipbes:Report ipbes:PPA16 ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Erratum: a) The title “International Code of Conduct on the Distribution and Use of Pesticides of the Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (FAO)” has been changed to the “International Code of Conduct on Pesticide Management of the Food and Agriculture Organization and the World Health Organization of the United Nations” to reflect this revision made in 2014; b) A survey from 2004 and 2005 suggests that a total of 31 out of 51 countries who completed the survey questionnaire, or 61 per cent, were using it, and not 15 per cent. This correction has been made in the text." ;
    dcterms:identifier "FootnoteSPM.20" .

