    skos:prefLabel "Map of visited sites and detected proportional shifts in bumble-bee community composition in red clover seed fields in the last 70 years. Blue circles, all three periods; green circles, 1940s and present; blue squares, 1940s; yellow squares, 1960s; green squares, present. Proportion of bumble-bee abundance for the different species is presented as cumulative proportions for the communities averaged among sites and years within each period." .

