        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/PPA16-6.8.2> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Gallai, N., J.-M. Salles, J. Settele, and B. E. Vaissière. 2009. Economic valuation of the vulnerability of world agriculture confronted with pollinator decline. Ecological Economics 68:810-821." ;
